# MASTER ARCHITECTURE & CONTEXT SPECIFICATION: proChef ERP/Inventory Management

## 1. PROJECT OVERVIEW & GOALS
You are assisting in building a highly optimized, modern, and modern-looking web application for "proChef" (https://www.prochef.rs/), a high-scale catering company operating across 3 physical locations:
1. Dobanovci (Main Hub / Central Warehouse)
2. Geneks
3. Zvezdara

The company prepares daily meals for major hospital clinical centers (Prva Hirurška, Hematologija, Alergologija, Klinički Centar) across Breakfast, Lunch, and Dinner shifts. They also handle custom private catering events and manage ~20 special diet patients ("Specijalci") daily, whose menus change frequently.

### Core Problems Being Solved:
1. **Outdated Legacy UI/UX**: Replacing an ugly, 30-year-old table-heavy ERP software that users hate using.
2. **Stock Discrepancies**: The real stock in cold rooms/storage never matched the legacy app.
3. **Bad Filtering**: Searching for items like "Kiseli krastavac" currently returns 50+ messy, unformatted Excel-like rows without clear categorization or barcodes.
4. **Extreme Ease of Use**: The UI must be so clean, intuitive, legible, and simple that any worker on any shift can update stock levels or view menus in seconds without training.

---

## 2. TECH STACK & SYSTEM ARCHITECTURE
- **Framework**: Next.js 14+ (App Router, React Server Components where applicable, Client Components for interactivity)
- **Language**: TypeScript (Strict typing for all DB models and UI components)
- **Styling**: Tailwind CSS (Clean, high-contrast, professional palette with Slate/Navy and Emerald/Orange accents)
- **UI Components**: shadcn/ui (Radix UI primitives)
- **Database & Auth**: Supabase (PostgreSQL with RLS, Supabase Auth)
- **Icons**: Lucide React
- **Table Engine**: TanStack Table v8 (`@tanstack/react-table`)

---

## 3. STRICT FOLDER & FILE STRUCTURE
Maintain a clean, highly scalable directory structure:

src/
├── app/                  # Next.js App Router routes
│   ├── (auth)/           # Authentication routes (login, register)
│   ├── (dashboard)/      # Protected dashboard routes
│   │   ├── utrosak/      # Inventory / Stock tracking page
│   │   ├── jelovnici/    # Bi-weekly menus & hospital shifts
│   │   ├── specijalci/   # Special diet patient management
│   │   ├── fakture/      # Invoicing module
│   │   └── page.tsx      # Main Dashboard overview
│   ├── api/              # API routes (Webhooks, barcode scans, etc.)
│   ├── layout.tsx        # Root layout
│   └── page.tsx          # Landing / Redirection page
├── components/           # Reusable UI components
│   ├── ui/               # Atomic shadcn/ui components (button, card, input...)
│   ├── layout/           # Sidebar, Header, LocationSwitcher, UserMenu
│   ├── modules/          # Feature-specific components
│   │   ├── utrosak/      # Stock Table, Barcode Modal, Quick Subtract Form
│   │   ├── jelovnici/    # Shift view, Week 1 / Week 2 selector
│   │   └── specijalci/   # Special patients list and notes
│   └── shared/           # Common badges, status indicators, search bars
├── lib/                  # Utilities, Supabase clients, helper functions
│   ├── supabase/         # client.ts, server.ts, middleware.ts
│   ├── utils.ts          # cn() helper, currency formatters, date helpers
│   └── constants.ts      # Enums, static options (locations, categories)
├── types/                # TypeScript interface definitions
│   ├── database.types.ts # Auto-generated / custom Supabase DB types
│   └── index.ts          # UI specific types

